{
  "id": "s5-when-did-you-know",
  "title": "職位不是我",
  "lines": [
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雨澄看了我幾秒，把手收回膝上。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "admit" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "好。那我還能決定什麼？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "admit" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "我失去收入，你失去今晚的胃口。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "她把兩根手指分開，比出一小段距離。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "不是同一種不容易。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "雅琳沒有看我，只在平板上記下一行。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "deflect" }] },

    { "speaker": "zeng-yalin", "text": "周主管，這句不在核准資訊裡。沒有保留職位的轉圜方案。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "bargain" }] },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "所以根本沒有轉圜，還要我先配合流程？", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "bargain" }] },
    { "speaker": null, "kind": "narration", "text": "我想接話，雨澄已經轉過頭來。", "conditions": [{ "variable": "choice3", "operator": "eq", "value": "bargain" }] },

    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "你什麼時候知道的？" },
    { "speaker": "zhou-yuan", "text": "兩週前知道公司在評估。今天下午拿到最終名單。" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "上週你還說，下季會有新安排。" },
    { "speaker": "lin-yucheng", "text": "那天我們改到十一點。你還把咖啡放在我桌上。" }
  ],
  "choicePrompt": "你記得的是什麼？",
  "choices": [
    { "id": "memory-food", "text": "「妳晚餐只吃了兩片餅乾。」", "next": "s5-memory-food", "minor": true },
    { "id": "memory-coffee", "text": "「妳說，等產品上線要請我喝一杯不像辦公室的咖啡。」", "next": "s5-memory-coffee", "minor": true },
    { "id": "memory-unsaid", "text": "「我本來想在那天告訴妳，最後沒有。」", "next": "s5-memory-unsaid", "minor": true }
  ]
}
